{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長嶋凛桜です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう*ˊᵕˋ*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は土曜日ですね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなゆっくり休めてるかな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事や勉強を頑張った皆さんもお疲れさまです🍵"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も頑張ってえらいえらい!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は読書の秋を過ごし中です📖 ̖́-"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日は1日で1冊読み終えちゃったり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "月に一度か二度やってくる本を大量に買いたい欲に襲われ今日は3冊小説を買っちゃいました👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せだぁ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobNjsldH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobbJBxyq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りおたんの私服"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前ブログで書いた天使コーデです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobygpJip.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後ろのリボンがとっても可愛い🎀"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobEqLFgR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いイヤリングも付けてみたの"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなに大きいイヤリング着けるの初めて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近ハンドメイドのアクセサリーを見るのにハマってます🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この写真は10月4日のリアルミート＆グリートだけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12日にもリアミがありましたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "当日体調不良で出れなくなってしまって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私に会いに来てくれた方、本当にごめんなさい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今は体調も回復してスーパー元気です☀️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobd9lwu4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会